#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:53
msgid ""
"Your identity on this mesh — the device name shown to other peers and the "
"network you're connected to."
msgstr ""
"Vaš identitet na ovoj mreži — naziv uređaja koji se prikazuje drugim "
"korisnicima i mreža na koju ste povezani."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:70
msgid "Rename this device on the network"
msgstr "Preimenuj ovaj uređaj na mreži"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:85
msgid ""
"Manual setup — expand to paste a server URL and pre-auth key when you "
"already received them from your administrator. Most users should sign in "
"through the panel button above instead."
msgstr ""
"Ručno postavljanje — proširite da biste zalijepili URL poslužitelja i pred-"
"autentifikacijski ključ ako ste ih već primili od administratora. Većina "
"korisnika trebala bi se prijaviti putem gumba na ploči iznad."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:98
msgid ""
"Address of the coordination server (e.g. vpn.example.org). The https:// "
"scheme is added automatically if you omit it."
msgstr ""
"Adresa koordinacijskog poslužitelja (npr. vpn.example.org). Shema https:// "
"dodaje se automatski ako je izostavite."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:110
msgid ""
"One-time or reusable key created on the server (starts with 'hskey-auth-'). "
"Used to register this device automatically without opening a browser."
msgstr ""
"Jednokratni ili višekratni ključ kreiran na poslužitelju (počinje s 'hskey-"
"auth-'). Koristi se za automatsku registraciju ovog uređaja bez otvaranja "
"preglednika."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:123
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:190
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:418
msgid "Device name on the network"
msgstr "Naziv uređaja na mreži"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:126
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN — this is the Tailscale"
" hostname, NOT your computer's name and NOT your user. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'."
msgstr ""
"Naziv pod kojim se ovaj uređaj prikazuje drugim korisnicima na VPN-u — ovo "
"je Tailscale hostname, a NE naziv vašeg računala i NE vaše korisničko ime. "
"Mala slova, znamenke i crtice. Primjer: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-"
"pc'."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:143
msgid ""
"Persist the server, key and device name above. Won't connect — press Connect"
" afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Trajno spremi gornji poslužitelj, ključ i naziv uređaja. Neće se povezati — "
"nakon toga pritisnite Poveži se."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:162
msgid ""
"When on, BigLace runs 'tailscale up' as soon as it launches, so you join the"
" mesh without clicking Connect every time."
msgstr ""
"Kada je uključeno, BigLace pokreće 'tailscale up' čim se pokrene, tako da se"
" pridružujete mreži bez klikanja na Poveži se svaki put."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:170
msgid "Toggle auto-connect on startup"
msgstr "Uključi/isključi automatsko povezivanje pri pokretanju"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:181
msgid ""
"If the tunnel drops (network change, sleep, server hiccup), BigLace silently"
" retries with growing delays instead of leaving you offline until you "
"notice."
msgstr ""
"Ako tunel padne (promjena mreže, stanje mirovanja, problem s poslužiteljem),"
" BigLace tiho ponavlja pokušaj s rastućim odgodama umjesto da vas ostavi "
"izvan mreže dok ne primijetite."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:190
msgid "Toggle auto-reconnect"
msgstr "Uključi/isključi automatsko ponovno povezivanje"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:201
msgid ""
"Send a desktop toast when another device on your network goes online or "
"offline. Rapid bursts are coalesced into a single notification so you don't "
"get spammed during reconnects."
msgstr ""
"Pošalji obavijest na radnoj površini kada drugi uređaj na vašoj mreži "
"postane online ili offline. Brza ponavljanja se spajaju u jednu obavijest "
"kako ne biste bili zatrpani tijekom ponovnih povezivanja."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:210
msgid "Toggle peer-change notifications"
msgstr "Uključi/isključi obavijesti o promjenama korisnika"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:225
msgid ""
"Join or leave the mesh network. When connected, this device becomes "
"reachable by the other peers in your account."
msgstr ""
"Pridružite se ili napustite mesh mrežu. Kada ste povezani, ovaj uređaj "
"postaje dostupan ostalim peerovima na vašem računu."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:177
msgid ""
"Address of your BigScale panel (e.g. panel.example.org). The https:// scheme"
" is added automatically if you omit it."
msgstr ""
"Adresa vaše BigScale ploče (npr. panel.example.org). https:// shema se "
"dodaje automatski ako je izostavite."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:182
msgid "Your panel username — the one you use to sign in to the web panel."
msgstr ""
"Vaše korisničko ime za ploču — ono kojim se prijavljujete na web ploču."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:186
msgid ""
"Your panel password. Stored in the OS keyring (libsecret on Linux, Keychain "
"on macOS, Credential Manager on Windows)."
msgstr ""
"Vaša lozinka za ploču. Pohranjuje se u sistemski spremište ključeva "
"(libsecret na Linuxu, Keychain na macOS-u, Credential Manager na Windowsu)."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:193
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN — this is the Tailscale"
" hostname, NOT your computer's name and NOT your user. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'. Pick "
"something other peers will recognise."
msgstr ""
"Naziv pod kojim se ovaj uređaj prikazuje ostalim peerovima na VPN-u — ovo je"
" Tailscale hostname, a NE naziv vašeg računala i NE vaše korisničko ime. "
"Mala slova, znamenke i crtice. Primjer: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-"
"pc'. Odaberite nešto što će ostali peerovi prepoznati."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:442
msgid "Rename this device"
msgstr "Preimenuj ovaj uređaj"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:444
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: tales-laptop."
msgstr ""
"Naziv pod kojim se ovaj uređaj prikazuje ostalim peerovima na VPN-u. Mala "
"slova, znamenke i crtice. Primjer: tales-laptop."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:449
msgid "Save & apply"
msgstr "Spremi i primijeni"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:502
msgid "Saved. The new name will take effect the next time you connect."
msgstr "Spremljeno. Novi naziv stupa na snagu sljedeći put kada se povežete."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:526
msgid "Device renamed."
msgstr "Uređaj preimenovan."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:536
#, rust-format
msgid "Rename failed: {error}"
msgstr "Preimenovanje nije uspjelo: {error}"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:553
msgid "The device name can't be empty."
msgstr "Naziv uređaja ne može biti prazan."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:556
msgid "Use 63 characters or fewer."
msgstr "Koristite 63 znaka ili manje."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:560
msgid "The device name can't start or end with a hyphen."
msgstr "Naziv uređaja ne može započinjati niti završavati crticom."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:564
msgid "Only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens are allowed."
msgstr "Dopuštena su samo mala slova, znamenke i crtice."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/peer_row.rs:306
msgid "SSH login (override)"
msgstr "SSH prijava (zamjena)"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/peer_row.rs:336
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Spremljeno"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1031
msgid "(no device name)"
msgstr "(bez naziva uređaja)"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1345
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} devices are online"
msgstr "{count} uređaja je online"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1346
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} devices went offline"
msgstr "{count} uređaja je offline"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1348
#, rust-format
msgid "{on_count} online · {off_count} offline"
msgstr "{on_count} online · {off_count} offline"

